    "## 5. Frozen configurations and common final refits\n",
    "\n",
    "The following JSON is written **before** any Task 3 test predictions. It fixes the\n",
    "traditional settings, core ANN batches and validation-selected epochs, decision rule,\n",
    "seeds, feature order and final refit recipe. No configuration is revised after evaluation.\n",
    "Fit one common scaler on all 7,000 development rows and train all four final models on\n",
    "those scaled inputs. A final ANN is a fresh model trained for its chosen epoch count\n",
    "with a constant learning rate; development trial weights and schedules are not reused."
   ]
