    "## 7. Persistence and independent reload verification\n",
    "\n",
    "Traditional `.pkl` files contain complete fitted scaler/estimator pipelines, serialized with\n",
    "joblib's compressed pickle format. They accept raw rows with the ordered predictor names.\n",
    "ANN `.h5` files contain the complete final-refit network, configuration, weights and optimizer.\n",
    "Apply the separately saved common scaler before ANN inference, then use Softmax argmax.\n",
    "Development and final histories are saved separately. Reload verification runs in a fresh\n",
    "Python process and compares all 3,000 test rows: exact class equality and probability\n",
    "tolerance `atol=1e-6, rtol=1e-6`. Only load trusted pickle files."
   ]
